  <trk>
    <name>Day 2</name>
    <desc>Section 22 – Stepantsminda to Tbilisi

Kazbegi National Park is remarkable for its tall mountains and snowy peak views, but it&#039;s time to say goodbye for now and continue the journey with slow moving tractor trailers hauling goods from Russia... You will eventually descend into the town of Pasanauri - arguably the best town for eating Khinkali - do not miss this unique opportunity! The last 30 kilometers of this section is a paved twisty road via the beautiful Sabaduri Forest within Tbilisi National Park. Try to reach Tbilisi before dark, park your horse there and blend into the crowd. Eat, drink and party like there&#039;s no tomorrow!</desc>
    <number>2</number>
    <extensions>
      <gpxx:TrackExtension>
        <gpxx:DisplayColor>Purple</gpxx:DisplayColor>
      </gpxx:TrackExtension>
